      "notes": [
        "This profile includes CPU/NUMA/cache discovery, LinuxIO with native Linux sysfs PCI discovery, synthetic topologies and the built-in XML backend. External libpciaccess probing is explicitly disabled through the upstream configure header-cache setting; GUI/Cairo, libudev, GPU/OpenCL/CUDA/NVML/RSMI/LevelZero/GL plugins and libxml2 remain disabled.",
